WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.450
Two projects. Where does the invoice start?

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.700
Graphify builds a graph of how their code connects.

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:10.300
Ask about one event. The graph points
from Orders to Billing.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.900
The result takes you to the exact line.
